{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41561","headline":"春晚谣 · 张泌","name":"春晚谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨微微，烟霏霏，小庭半拆红蔷薇。\n钿筝斜倚画屏曲，零落几行金鴈飞。\n萧关梦断无寻处，万叠春波起南浦。\n凌乱杨花扑绣帘，晚窗时有流莺语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}